      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "text": "你觉得大家对你的最大误解是什么可能是有人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 4.799,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 3.446,
      "text": "觉得我会胡说八道"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 7.32,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 5.639,
      "text": "但其实我这个人很少胡说八道"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 11.359,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "我讲的东西背后都有一些书"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 14.16,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "所以要胡说八道也是那些作者胡说八道"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 19.08,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 15.04,
      "text": "但是相对来讲我讲的东西信噪比比较高"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 22.32,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 20.28,
      "text": "但是有判断能力的人很少"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 28.24,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 23.12,
      "text": "再加上现在早期是断章取义的多就大家瞎剪"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 29.519,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 28.24,
      "text": "很多东西剪到一块"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 35.215,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 30.199,
      "text": "那意思就完全歪曲了现在就变成瞎说了就是"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 40.0,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 35.443,
      "text": "AI 直接用我的头像和声音说特别恶心的话"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 43.853,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 40.88,
      "text": "所以我经常会碰到有好多人说讨厌你说的什么"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 47.371,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 43.853,
      "text": "观点我说我没说过这观点从来没有过我说我也"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 50.519,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 47.371,
      "text": "反对这样的观点它就是 AI 因为那些很"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 52.12,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 50.519,
      "text": "糟糕的观点更容易卖书"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 54.359,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 53.079,
      "text": "卖那些很烂的书"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 59.32,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 55.719,
      "text": "这个特别可怕所以 AI 如果不立法我们就"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 61.16,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 59.32,
      "text": "完了那就真的变坏人了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 66.464,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-19",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 61.92,
      "text": "那天我刷到一个短视频就是我然后说员工都是"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 67.4,
      "id": "youtube-ezMQfmxf31w#cue-20",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 66.464,
      "text": "白眼狼"
    },
